#: /Game/Widgets/W_Errors/W_ClientBadver.W_ClientBadVer_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock.Text
msgctxt ",CB89494C411C53F299689D86AAE86C31"
msgid "You are running an older build of Budget Backrooms compared to the host and a connection could not be established. Are you on the right branch? Did you verify game integrity? Please check your game version."
msgstr "Sie führen im Vergleich zum Host eine ältere Version von Budget Backrooms aus und es konnte keine Verbindung hergestellt werden. Sind Sie in der richtigen Filiale? Haben Sie die Spielintegrität überprüft? Bitte überprüfen Sie Ihre Spielversion."

#. Key:	CD68D39E4585B1B005DD54A2BF73B23E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/W_SaveMigration/W_SaveMigrationNew.W_SaveMigrationNew_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock.Text
#: /Game/Widgets/W_SaveMigration/W_SaveMigrationNew.W_SaveMigrationNew_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock.Text
msgctxt ",CD68D39E4585B1B005DD54A2BF73B23E"
msgid "Due to internal changes starting 0.0.18 Alpha and later, the older formats used in 0.0.17 and prior are no longer supported to further ease development of the game and compensate for past mistakes made by the developer while making this game.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Your existing savedata has been automatically migrated to the new format. Not everything might have been moved over due to internal restructuring. Achievements are not migrated. Should you have issues in game, please try proceeding with a save reset under Settings -> General Settings"
msgstr ""

#. Key:	CDE46AA4452AAD65BCC94785448BD1CA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Multiplayer/W_UnstableMP.W_UnstableMP_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock.Text
#: /Game/Widgets/Multiplayer/W_UnstableMP.W_UnstableMP_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock.Text
msgctxt ",CDE46AA4452AAD65BCC94785448BD1CA"
msgid "This version of Multiplayer is temporarily not meant for consumer use, in a nutshell, it is not finished, just like this game.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"You are able to invite friends but what you're getting is just the barebones of Multiplayer without any sugar-coating. Many bugs to be expected.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"I am not responsible for any hacking, doxxing, IP Leaks and so on, I am trying my best."
msgstr "Diese Multiplayer-Version ist vorübergehend nicht für den Verbrauchergebrauch gedacht, kurz gesagt, sie ist noch nicht fertig, genau wie dieses Spiel.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Sie können Freunde einladen, aber was Sie bekommen, ist nur das Grundgerüst des Mehrspielermodus ohne jegliche Beschönigung. Viele Fehler sind zu erwarten.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Ich bin nicht verantwortlich für Hacking, Doxxing, IP-Leaks usw., ich gebe mein Bestes."

